0..75 Comment "// A dependent case over the circle owes the transport of its answer at the"
76..150 Comment "// point along the loop, through each endpoint\'s maps (#425): a map of any"
151..227 Comment "// arity whose one argument the point runs through, and a loop arm answering"
228..303 Comment "// the loop by its name. A row the tree refuses today states the refusal it"
304..341 Comment "// meets and the issue that holds it."
